WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.420
EXL team, I'm Travis Stephenson with Rapid Studios.

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:07.300
Here's a small idea for the return after a break.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.700
